<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ house price index falls 0.6 pct in Sept qtr.</title>
<headline>NZ house price index falls 0.6 pct in Sept qtr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valuation New Zealand on Monday said its provisional house price index fell 0.6 percent to 1444 in the  September quarter.  </p>
<p>In main urban areas, the house price index fell 0.7 percent to 1464. In the Auckland area it fell 1.6 percent to 1613, and in the Wellington area it fell 0.1 percent to 1072.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
